### Health check
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### Get all applications
GET http://localhost:3001/api/applications

### Get one application
GET http://localhost:3001/api/applications/1

### Get non-existing application (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/applications/999

### Create application (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Test Company",
  "position": "Junior Developer",
  "status": "applied"
}

### Create invalid application (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "",
  "status": "hired"
}
###
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/applications/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "offer"
}

### Delete application (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/applications/2